allowlist/lists/sbx-balanced.yaml lists host names taken from the
default "balanced" network policy of Docker Sandboxes (sbx), by Docker,
Inc., as printed by `sbx policy ls --json` (sbx v0.54.0), regrouped and
rewritten in this project's format. Docker Sandboxes is not part of
this product.
